  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="unit_cloth_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>the cloth as a unit of account for customs: the statutory cloth (of assize); the Books of Rates reckon other cloths as fractions of it ("6 statutes for a clothe")</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
